  <reporting-org ref="XM-DAC-47066" type="40">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Organization for Migration (IOM)</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting the Establishment of a Humanitarian Programme for Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through the project, IOM continues to ensure an adequate humanitarian response to the needs of affected populations and host communities in crisis related contexts globally in an efficient and timely manner in 2022. The German Federal Foreign Office Humanitarian Programme for Africa (GHPA) comprises two components to achieve two outcomes. The first is determined as a sustained response mechanism and is structured around on-going crises and responses with predictable needs and aims at sustaining the response on-going to provide lifesaving assistance. The second is determined as a rapid response mechanism to respond in a timely manner to sudden onsets and deteriorating circumstances that appear during the period of implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
